      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Sharpen Footage\n\nAdds apparent detail back to a clip after denoising or downscaling. It runs locally through ffmpeg with no API key or per-run cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" takes your video. \"Sharpen\" applies a luma amount of 1.5 and a chroma amount of 0.5, keeping chroma low to avoid colour fringing. \"Result\" returns the sharpened clip.\n\n**Try this:** Lower the luma amount on \"Sharpen\" to 0.8 for a subtler pass on footage with visible grain or compression noise."
        },
